 ## Summary
 
-Detailed reference for the BBPOS WisePad 3 — handheld mobile reader with display and PIN pad. Available in 25 non-US countries. BLE or USB (Android only). Compatible with iOS, Android, React Native SDKs.
+[[stripe]]'s [[stripe-terminal|Terminal]] reference describes the BBPOS WisePad 3, a handheld reader with a display and PIN pad for PIN-authenticated payments. It connects to the iOS, Android, or React Native Terminal SDK by Bluetooth Low Energy, with USB limited to Android.
+
+## Availability
+
+The 2026-05-01 reference banner contains 24 country codes. The 2026-11-07 banner contains 37 codes, adding HK, BG, HR, CY, EE, HU, LV, LI, LT, MT, RO, SK, and SI. The November [[source-stripe-terminal-setup-wisepad3|WisePad 3 setup]] and [[source-stripe-terminal-mobile-readers|mobile-reader overview]] captures show the same 37 codes. The country lists describe this reader and do not establish feature-specific eligibility such as on-reader tipping.
+
+> [!note] Mexico configuration and reader availability
+> November lists Mexico in its country-version, configuration-history, and key-identifier tables. The November reader banner, setup banner, and mobile-reader overview omit Mexico. Reader availability for Mexico remains unresolved from these documents.
 
